# Picker label of the Blue Dragon's summons (row 156) in a scripted Blue Dragon fight (battle id 0x0B), run with
# --save. Same trick as boss_sasquatch. Jian attacks with A presses; the bubbles join after the dragon summons
# them, and the third Fight picker shows the dragon and two front-row bubbles. Right moves onto a bubble: the
# bottom bar must say "Bubble" with a blue sphere icon.
include boot_from_save
include cheats_strong
pin u16 0x020B77EC 6
press Right 40
press Down,Right 40
press Right 40
press Down 80
wait 200
unpin
wait 30
shot boss_field
dump 0x0213B930 0x200 inv_before
peek u32 0x020B4694 jian_exp_before
peek u32 0x020B4664 jian_level_before
peek u32 0x020B4824 silver_before
poke u16 0x020B7838 1
poke u16 0x020B783A 11
poke u32 0x020B0010 0x73
wait 240
battlers
press A 3
wait 30
press A 3
wait 30
